name: ['Archangel Avacyn // Avacyn, the Purifier', "Arguel's Blood Fast // Temple of Aclazotz", 'Arlinn Kord // Arlinn, Embraced by the Moon', 'Bloodline Keeper // Lord of Lineage', 'Brisela, Voice of Nightmares', 'Bruna, the Fading Light // Brisela, Voice of Nightmares', 'Chandra, Fire of Kaladesh // Chandra, Roaring Flame', 'Delver of Secrets // Insectile Aberration', 'Elbrus, the Binding Blade // Withengar Unbound', 'Garruk Relentless // Garruk, the Veil-Cursed', 'Gisela, the Broken Blade // Brisela, Voice of Nightmares', 'Huntmaster of the Fells // Ravager of the Fells', "Jace, Vryn's Prodigy // Jace, Telepath Unbound", 'Kytheon, Hero of Akros // Gideon, Battle-Forged', 'Liliana, Heretical Healer // Liliana, Defiant Necromancer', 'Nissa, Vastwood Seer // Nissa, Sage Animist']
